(_When_ polio strikes some child in a community, it is only natural) Tj T*
(for all parents in that community to become concerned about their) Tj T*
(own children. It is well to keep in mind, however, that even during) Tj T*
(an epidemic the number of persons who get the disease is very small) Tj T*
